"use client";

// Cyrus neon icon set (v4, owner concept 2026-10-07). One system for everything: 24-grid line
// icons, 1.6 stroke, round caps/joins, drawn either in currentColor (inside text) or with a
// neon gradient stroke + soft glow (`tone`). Game emblems and mod cubes are original drawings on
// a 48-grid in the same style. NO official game logos or publisher art: the emblems only evoke
// each game (a pixel grass cube, a stylised A, a raptor head, a fox-like creature, a bolted
// plate, a V rune); licensed logos can be dropped in later.
//
// Line-icon geometry is from Lucide (https://lucide.dev), ISC licensed (some icons derive from
// Feather, MIT):
//   ISC License. Copyright (c) 2026 Lucide Icons and Contributors.
//   Permission to use, copy, modify, and/or distribute this software for any purpose with or
